3. The following activities are qualifying activities for the purposes of section 43ZH of the Act:
(a)the sale of goods;
(b)the provision of engineering or technical services;
(c)the provision of computer‑based information and other computer related services;
(d)the provision of entertainment, leisure or recreational services;
(e)the provision of publishing services;
(f)the provision of education and other related services;
(g)the provision of medical services;
(h)the provision of logistics services;
(i)the provision of business consultancy, management or professional services.
